{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three terms of an arithmetic sequence are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/76142730ad27f345c66d8623ad85fb9feba6a90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 3$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/6/d365ff0dfa746638951885d074192e44da8320c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x - 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae961150ab2011a5139c435f8a8f01a03f1efb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/85727a3ea4f5d7ba25bc591590b0e085bca557b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc0b57389fa1f1d7ffa9d363c45210534ef3ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 255 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 502 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1004 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1506 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8037$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"469\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As this is an arithmetic sequence, the difference must be constant: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d259fafe93dbb17a21cf2b73ed9ecb15b3c6613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5x-11) - (2x-3) = (3x+1) - (5x-11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"345\" height=\"18\" />. This solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. The first three terms then are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. In general, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267123a0d0ccc46d0c1972827d115d757041d5c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1bd7186744b21a36036b731c250fafbbe27cfe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+4n=2009$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/50429736b91911ab9a75f1f17d7854e5bf2ae38f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{502}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A\">2009 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problem